   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY27",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We continue to expect FY27 underlying profit before tax of between £55m and £65m. The strong H1 performance combined with accelerated investments in marketing and technology in H2 will result in underlying profit before tax being weighted towards H1.",
